  "purpose": "(Clinical Focus: Codes representing how telecommunication addresses are used—such as emergency contact, direct line, answering service, pager, or mobile contact.),(Data Element Scope: Used to specify the function or intended purpose of a telecommunication address in clinical records and data exchange.),(Inclusion Criteria: HL7 address-use codes under the _TelecommunicationAddressUse category.),(Exclusion Criteria: Exclude codes outside the telecommunication category—such as postal or general address uses.)",
